Hi Jamie,

Welcome to your May CloudOffice Digest! This month, we’re excited to share some new features designed to make collaboration even smoother, along with a few tips to help you get the most out of your workspace.

**What’s New?**
- **Real-Time Co-Editing in Docs**: Now you can see changes from your team as they happen, with live cursors and instant updates. [Learn more](https://www.cloudoffice.example.org/docs/real-time-editing)
- **Enhanced Search in Drive**: Find files faster with improved filters and keyword suggestions. [Try it out](https://drive.cloudoffice.example.org)

**Tip of the Month**
Did you know you can customize your dashboard to show only the apps and files you use most? [Watch the tutorial](https://help.cloudoffice.example.org/dashboard-customization)

**Upcoming Webinar**
Join us on May 28th for a live demo of our new project management tools. [Register here](https://events.cloudoffice.example.org/webinar-may-2024)

As always, your feedback helps us improve. Let us know what you think of these updates by replying to this email or visiting our [Community Forum](https://community.cloudoffice.example.org).

Happy collaborating!

The CloudOffice Team

